      "state": {
        "Text": "09 \u2014 NUMBERS AND DATES\n\nA sine wave, a circle, a 3-4-5 triangle solved four ways, compound interest, a thermostat, paging, logic puzzles (a coin, two-way light switches, a door alarm, a weekend check), dates: parts, month end, time zones, cron, Unix time, and formulas typed as text.\n\nPress Run Once (Ctrl\u002BR) and read the Outputs. Each task sits in its own group; collapse the ones you are not reading (double-click a header)."
