  "notes": [
    {
      "id": "a0fbed74-0a7c-473a-9825-a94285146a2f",
      "target": "a28134cd-ecde-4a22-81d0-31a5662ed6cd",
      "x": 1106,
      "y": 0,
      "w": 260,
      "text": "Range runs per item through Map Range and Sin, into Plot: one point per item of the list."
    },
    {
      "id": "34bf291c-4a3e-4035-8daa-4a71cc71c976",
      "target": "217ccbc0-fef0-4a87-b969-824702f80e4b",
      "x": 1346,
      "y": 0,
      "w": 260,
      "text": "The statistics of the Random Gaussian samples settle as Continuous (Ctrl\u002BShift\u002BR) collects more."
    },
    {
      "id": "49112bd6-fa57-4cc7-8649-fdd603ac2aee",
      "target": "34f87ac7-36b9-4518-9e8a-a20ea32e7baf",
      "x": 1456,
      "y": 0,
      "w": 260,
      "text": "Expression evaluates a formula typed as text, in x, y, z and w. Fed from Range it runs once per item: a damped wave into Plot. On the right, the distance between (x, y) and (z, w). Hover the formula box for the syntax."
    },
    {
      "id": "607b8b85-c228-473f-80b1-3f1cc32daf32",
      "target": "aad15642-faab-4e31-b6d4-35c7a1ce6864",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -110,
      "text": "The machine\u0027s uptime (in hours) reads as \u00223 days, 4 hours\u0022; 93784 seconds as a clock and as ISO 8601 (P1DT2H3M4S), the form APIs and config files use."
    }
  ]
}